+    The monitor is taken after each app's volume and before the sink's
+    (PipeWire's monitor.channel-volumes is off by default), so the PC's master
+    volume does not reach the Echoes but an app's does: Firefox left at 63%
+    in the mixer sends YouTube 12 dB quieter while the master reads 100%.
